Hi {Owner},

I build websites and sales tools for manufacturers around {City}. On the {Business Name} site I couldn't find spec sheets by product, a way for a buyer to send drawings with annual volumes, or shift details for the roles you're hiring.

I built a sample before asking for your time: a spec sheet library by product family, a contract manufacturing RFQ with drawing upload, a rep and distributor locator, a quality page and production careers by shift, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If it's useful, I move it to your domain and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, changes and new products. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Would thirty minutes with you and your sales lead work this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
